AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0700247> "RAB18 deficiency results from biallelic pathogenic variants in RAB3GAP1, RAB3GAP2, RAB18, or TBC1D20. Studies suggest that variation(s) in these genes affect RAB18 regular function. (https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK475670/)")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0700247> "RAB18 deficiency")
